  <steps>
    <step>Schema: query sprk_todo's live metadata to confirm no sprk_reportcard lookup exists (re-verify — reportcard.md's finding may be stale by execution time). If still absent, add a new OneToMany relationship (sprk_reportcard [1] → sprk_todo [N]) via dataverse-create-schema, matching the naming convention of existing sprk_todo regarding lookups (verify exact SchemaName casing via metadata query before referencing it in code, same discipline as task 002's sprk_Event lookup). Publish customizations. Verify via describe.</step>
    <step>Add the confirmed-casing entry to TODO_REGARDING_CATALOG in TodoRegardingUpdateBuilder.ts.</step>
    <step>Create reportCardService.createReportCard mirroring workAssignmentService: discover sprk_reportcard nav-props → build payload from the manifest (sprk_name required, sprk_narrative, sprk_duedate, 8 assigned-resource lookups per reportcard.md's exact field list) → BU defaults cascade if applicable → applyResolverFields (Matter + Project) → createRecord('sprk_reportcard', entity) → warnings array. No file pipeline (owner decision — no files step).</step>
    <step>Create CreateReportCardWizard wrapping CreateRecordWizard: associateToStep config (Matter + Project entityTypes, initialAssociation/lockAssociation threaded through exactly like CreateEventWizard.tsx), Enter Info step (new CreateReportCardStep collecting the manifest fields — 8 optional resource lookups, use LookupField per the AssignWorkFollowOnStep/AssignWorkStep pattern for consistency), NO Add Files step, Next Steps via WizardFollowOns (Send Email / Add To Do / Assign Work).</step>
    <step>Wire wizardRegistry: replace the 'report-card' placeholder line with the real lazy import.</step>
    <step>Unit tests per ADR-038: reportCardService resolver-field population, the new TODO_REGARDING_CATALOG entry, wizard Enter Info validation (sprk_name required, others optional).</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>Read, Grep, Edit, Write, Skill(dataverse-create-schema), ToolSearch (mcp__dataverse__describe), Skill(adr-check), Skill(code-review)</tools>
  <outputs>components/CreateReportCardWizard/ + registry entry + new sprk_todo→sprk_reportcard lookup + TODO_REGARDING_CATALOG entry + tests.</outputs>

